      <h2 class="h2" id="process-h2">From First Email to Genova Port — Our Production Process for Italian Buyers</h2>
      <p class="lead">We work with Italian fashion brands ranging from first-time founders placing their debut collection to established labels reordering every season. The process is the same in both cases — structured, documented, and managed by a single merchandising contact who handles your account from initial enquiry through to final shipment.</p>

      <div class="steps" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div class="step">
