            <div class="step-body">Once you confirm the quote, we source fabric from our vetted mill partners — GOTS certified organic cotton mills, OEKO-TEX certified knit and woven suppliers, GRS certified recycled polyester sources. Proto samples are completed and shipped via DHL Express within 14 days of brief confirmation. We offer up to 10 revision rounds at no charge. Italian-language measurement charts and fit comments provided on request.</div>
